    "en": "Saudi imam and Qur'an reciter. He led Taraweeh and Tahajjud prayers at Masjid al-Haram in Makkah from 2015, was appointed one of its permanent imams on 12 October 2019, and gave its sermons as a khatib from December 2022. He was reappointed in March 2024."
